{"@type":"Question","name":"Are you familiar with Powell permitting and remodeling requirements?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Elevate Remodeling is registered with the City of Powell and has completed permitted remodeling projects in the area. The City of Powell requires building permits for remodeling work including kitchens, bathrooms, and basements, as well as contractor registration for anyone performing permitted work. We handle all permitting coordination and inspections on your behalf."}},
{"@type":"Question","name":"What types of remodeling projects do you complete in Powell?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We specialize in kitchen remodeling, bathroom remodeling, basement finishing, and whole-home renovations throughout Powell and the greater Columbus area."}},
{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you help upgrade the finishes in a newer or well-built home?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Absolutely. Many Powell homes are well-constructed but were finished with production-grade materials — standard cabinetry, builder tile, and basic fixtures. We help homeowners replace these with custom cabinetry, premium countertops, quality hardware, and design details that bring the interior up to the level of the home itself."}},
{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you help with design selections?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Our process includes design guidance, material selections, layout planning, and detailed project coordination to help homeowners make confident decisions throughout the remodeling process."}},
{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you work on whole home renovations?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. In addition to kitchens and bathrooms, we complete full interior renovations that can include reconfigured layouts, flooring, stair updates, mudrooms, custom cabinetry, and cohesive finish selections throughout the home."}}
